# 049 · The multi-day test fire

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.6.0](../roadmap.md#v060)

## What

Several campaigns in all three modes run for days on several rigs, with failures injected along the way: crashes, restarts, a full disk and a lost model.

## Why

This proves that Thermite runs unattended. It is the last milestone of the v1 design.

## Done when

- [ ] Every campaign continues or ends correctly through each injected failure, and a report is written.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

- It needs the owner's go, because it uses shared machines for days.

## Progress

- 2026-10-19: Goal written from the roadmap.

